{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48876","headline":"溪东岑望天都山 · 朱景玄","name":"溪东岑望天都山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"目望浮山丘，梯云上东岑。\n羣峰争入冥，巉巉生太阴。\n昔贤此升仙，结构穷耸深。\n未晓日先照，当昼色半沈。\n风泉雪霜飞，云树琼玉林。\n大道非闭隔，无路不可寻。\n窥镜澄夙虑，望坛起敬心。\n一从呼子安，永绝金玉音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱景玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48876.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48876","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}